OL,3,GNEWSADozens of homes approved despite
OL,4,Adust worries
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for 70 homes have been approved
OL,7,Ffor a town - despite council concerns
OL,8,Fabout dust.
OL,10,FDuring summer, residents near the
OL,11,FFolley, Swindon Village, in Cheltenham,
OL,12,FGloucestershire, claimed dust from a
OL,13,Fnearby building site had settled on
OL,14,Ftheir homes and gardens.
OL,16,FThe same developer - E G Carter and Co
OL,17,FLtd - has now been granted permission
OL,18,Fto build 70 new affordable homes for
OL,19,Fthe council on land off Shelley Road at
OL,20,Fthe former Monkscroft School site.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
